      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Complex 1 is a Dy4 SMM with two slow magnetic relaxation processes under zero dc field, assigned to the two inequivalent Dy sites. χmT at 300 K is 56.84 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 56.68). Upon cooling, χmT stays roughly constant to 85 K, decreases to 57.96 at 22 K, rises to 59.6 at 5 K, then falls to 45.05 at 1.8 K, consistent with thermal depopulation plus ferromagnetic coupling and low-T ZFS/Zeeman/competing AF coupling. Magnetization at 1.8 K reaches 21.34 μB (not 40 NμB saturation); M vs H/T curves do not superimpose, indicating anisotropy. Zero-field ac data (1–1000 Hz, 1.8–25 K) are frequency-dependent with χ″ maxima 1.37–4.87 cm3 mol−1 (1000–10 Hz) between 20 and 12 K; two peaks at 32 and 325 Hz. A 3600 Oe dc field only slightly shifts peaks but makes the two processes clearer. Arrhenius fit of high-T χ″ vs frequency gives Ueff = 48.14 K and τ0 = 6.46 × 10−6 s, the highest among reported tetranuclear salen-type Dy SMMs at zero field.",
        "measurements": [
          {
            "property_type": "magnetic",
            "name": "χmT",
            "value": 56.84,
            "unit": "cm3 K mol−1",
            "conditions": "300 K, 100 Oe dc"
          },
          {
            "property_type": "magnetic",
            "name": "χmT",
            "value": 57.96,
            "unit": "cm3 K mol−1",
            "conditions": "22 K, 100 Oe dc"
          },
          {
            "property_type": "magnetic",
            "name": "χmT",
            "value": 59.6,
            "unit": "cm3 K mol−1",
            "conditions": "5 K, 100 Oe dc"
          },
          {
            "property_type": "magnetic",
            "name": "χmT",
            "value": 45.05,
            "unit": "cm3 K mol−1",
            "conditions": "1.8 K, 100 Oe dc"
          },
          {
            "property_type": "magnetic",
            "name": "magnetization",
            "value": 21.34,
            "unit": "μB",
            "conditions": "1.8 K, 70 kOe"
          },
